   "en": "Neverland no Shirakawa-san"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ネバーランドの白川さん"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Shirakawa, is a high school girl whose mature appearance and behavior make her the object of admiration. However, the real Shirakawa is not the person she is rumored to be, but a hardcore \"fighting shape-shifting girl\" otaku. The only one who understands her is Tateishi, a cool and handsome guy who is also a member of the Kyudo club. Like Shirakawa, Tateishi attracts the eyes of many people from afar, but in fact, he is also a \"Sentai\" otaku. \n\nA love comedy unfolds between the two who share a secret hobby: Sunday morning children's hero shows."
  },
